{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/lunar-exalted/1235400-lunars-playtest","id":1235400,"title":"Lunars Playtest","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted","Lunar Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2018-07-15T19:52:10-07:00","id":1235400,"title":"Lunars Playtest","content":"If you want to know about it, we squee through the whole thing like self-control-impaired children at Willy Wonka's Chocolate Factory on the new episode of The Deliberative.<br /> <br /> &lt;whispers&gt; The episode is actually live right now if you go and look...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Host of <a href=\"http://www.fivepoles.com/podcast/\" target=\"_blank\">The Deliberative Podcast</a><br /> Host of <a href=\"https://tca.edennian.com\" target=\"_blank\">Trinity Continuum Airwaves</a><br /> Original Creator of the complete <a href=\"https://www.fantasygrounds.com/forums/showthread.php?9238-Rules-Lite-New-World-of-Darkness&amp;highlight=\" target=\"_blank\">nWoD conversion of Fantasy Grounds 2</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12730-pneumapilot","name":"PneumaPilot","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12730_4.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"149"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-15T20:37:10-07:00","id":1235412,"title":"","content":"Listening and loving it already. Like that you guys spent a long time looking for hybrid animals. XD","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/717-monghani","name":"Monghani","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar717_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"358"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-15T21:37:52-07:00","id":1235420,"title":"","content":"Chimera Soul Expression is right up front and ready.<br /> <br /> Changing Face Transformation, somewhere down the line from Hybrid Body Transformation, allows you to set a different allocation for your Attribute dots for some transformation; multiple purchases for multiple configurations. Reminds me of Tony Tony Chopper, or Bruce Banner exchanging his intelligence for the Hulk's physical power.<br /> <br /> There's a Charm to use Strength instead of Dexterity for attack pools, and another to use your Stamina instead of Dexterity for your Parry value calculation.<br /> <br /> You can pull out your hairs, quills, stingers, presumably fangs, and use them as arrows, which can grow barbs and wings.<br /> <br /> Behemoth's Inhalation Prana lets you suck up all fog, smoke, or poison miasma, which you can then blow into an enemy's face. Wonder if it works with fire?<br /> <br /> Beast Mind Metanoia defeats social influence by changing your mind to an animal's. Sounds like Second Edition's Labyrinth of the Beast, but probably not as weak.<br /> <br /> Under the Wits Attribute is a Charm branch called Animal Kin, for familiars. One adds mutations to the familiar. Lots of team work stuff, like letting your familiar counterattack for you. Also, the Miniature Giant Space-Hamster Charm, that lets you turn a kaijuu into your personal Head Pet, if you're regretting evolving your Dratini into a Dragonite.<br /> <br /> You can grow a Greater Hearthstone in your body, and another that lets you slot Hearthstones from any source into your body.<br /> <br /> Mighty Ram Smash, a bit like Heaven Thunder Hammer, but you can't aim them skyward. You need the following Fatal Stryx Flight for that. Swooping Hybroc Death Strike lets you jump up after them and volleyball spike them back down.<br /> <br /> Bash through scenery, like a building.<br /> <br /> Change your inner shape so that you are immovable, but you become heavy enough to sink into mud or snap the tight-rope you're standing on.<br /> <br /> Each Attribute has a Heart's Blood Charm that allows you to gain a form in a new way. Strength lets you challenge someone to a wrestling match or a footrace, and if they honestly try and fail to beat you, you gain their Heart's Blood without killing them.<br /> <br /> <br /> Posting this now, continuing to listen.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>formerly Tornado Wolf, formerly Inugami","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":11}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/636-sunder-the-gold","name":"Sunder the Gold","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar636_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5515"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-15T21:43:30-07:00","id":1235422,"title":"","content":"Pedantic note: the stingers of hymenopteran insects like wasps and bees are modified ovipositors. You're going to need female plumbing for that... (^VVVVVVV^)<br /> <br /> Edit: Also, there seems to be a fair measure of Attribute switching about, so Dexterity is going to be less essential. It's like that brutal strike merit from 2e, except balanced.<br /> <br /> (The Deadly Hugbear seems like it might leap from Werewolf to Exalted again!)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":23,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23-saur-ops-specialist","user":"Saur Ops Specialist","date":". 07-16-2018, 12:46 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23-saur-ops-specialist","name":"Saur Ops Specialist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9371"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-15T22:12:32-07:00","id":1235429,"title":"","content":"It seems Deadly Beastman Transformation completely shuts down Evocations, at present. <b>EDIT: This is false.</b><br /> <br /> Lunars currently don't need a special Charm or Knack or merit to steal human forms.<br /> <br /> <br /> Charms are printed in alphabetical order in regards to Attributes, which means you start with Appearance, which is apparently awesome.<br /> <br /> One of the playtesters complains that the Charms are no longer grouped by Physical, Social, and Mental categories.<br /> <br /> <br /> Instead of the Fury and Gift keywords and mechanics of Second Edition, a number of Charms now have Special Activation Rules like those for Martial Arts Charms, that help you activate certain Charms when you do certain things, like assume Deadly Beastman Transformation or -- I assume -- enter a berserker rage.<br /> <br /> <br /> &quot;Most times you can't use Charms when you're in an animal shape&quot;? <b>EDIT: This is false. </b>Unless they have the Protean keyword are thus compatible?<br /> <br /> <br /> Totemic Charms are like the Merged Charms of the previous Edition, but with more stringent and specific limitations. Wasp and Termite Dance is a &quot;pretty big&quot; Appearance Charm that Lunars with &quot;hive-dwelling&quot; spirit shapes can learn as a Charisma Charm following after Guiding the Flock.<br /> <br /> <br /> The Charisma Heart's Blood Charm allows you to bind someone with an oath like an Eclipse; you gain their form if they break it. Sounds manipulative, since you'd be trying to get them to swear oaths they can't keep.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>formerly Tornado Wolf, formerly Inugami","edited":{"userid":636,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/636-sunder-the-gold","user":"Sunder the Gold","date":". 07-17-2018, 12:18 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":7}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/636-sunder-the-gold","name":"Sunder the Gold","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar636_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5515"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-15T22:26:16-07:00","id":1235435,"title":"","content":"Vance corrected something on the Evocations front. It just knocks them down a notch in DBT. They misread it because they just got the doc in the last 24 hours. They're doing a deeper dive into it next week with more people making characters. Send them your questions and what you want them to look into.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/717-monghani","name":"Monghani","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar717_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"358"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-15T22:34:06-07:00","id":1235443,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Monghani</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/lunar-exalted/1235400-lunars-playtest?p=1235435#post1235435\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Vance corrected something on the Evocations front. It just knocks them down a notch in DBT. They misread it because they just got the doc in the last 24 hours. They're doing a deeper dive into it next week with more people making characters. Send them your questions and what you want them to look into.</div> </div> </div> </div>Did they also misread or misrepresent that &quot;can't use Charms in animal forms&quot; thing?<br /> <br /> I'm not panicking, just curious. If something that surprising is true, then there must be a good reason.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>formerly Tornado Wolf, formerly Inugami","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/636-sunder-the-gold","name":"Sunder the Gold","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar636_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5515"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-15T23:00:20-07:00","id":1235453,"title":"","content":"Cool. I can't listen now, so your summary is helpful Sunder, thanks.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>STing Bronze Age Exalted","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2402-the-wizard-of-oz","name":"The Wizard of Oz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2402_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-16T03:27:29-07:00","id":1235493,"title":"","content":"Hmmmm\u2026.<br /> <br /> This is not my favourite way of getting information about Lunar mechanics. I don't gel with podcasts in general, and this feels so disjointed and fragmentary; third-hand accounts and listening through keyholes. I would greatly prefer something more direct and organised.<br /> <br /> However, it's apparent that this is going to become part of the discourse now, so the options are extricate myself from Lunar discussions entirely until such time as the book starts getting previewed specifically, or just knuckle down.<br /> <br /> This playtest happened at a convention, yes? I presume that such a setting precluded signing non-disclosure agreements?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#00ffff\">I have approximate knowledge of many things.</span><br /> <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?threads/wip-xenoblade-chronicles-the-sword-can-see-the-future.835575/\" target=\"_blank\">Write up as I play Xenoblade Chronicles.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/158-isator-levi","name":"Isator Levi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar158_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17901"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-16T03:35:30-07:00","id":1235495,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Isator Levi</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/lunar-exalted/1235400-lunars-playtest?p=1235493#post1235493\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Hmmmm\u2026.<br /> I presume that such a setting precluded signing non-disclosure agreements?</div> </div> </div> </div>I got a PM about this, it's kosher and not a repeat of the great playtest leak.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><a href=\"https://swordofcreation.net/\" target=\"_blank\">Sword of Creation</a> a hub for Exalted related content</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":10}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7-lioness","name":"Lioness","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7_2.png","title":"Moderator","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5443"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-16T03:40:49-07:00","id":1235498,"title":"","content":"When I read the title I was already in &quot;poor Dev Team getting leaked again&quot;-mode, really glad to hear that it's not the case. Gonna listen to the podcast now.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/903-cheshire-cat","name":"Cheshire Cat","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar903_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"502"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-16T04:00:13-07:00","id":1235503,"title":"","content":"Vance gave the document to the podcasters and told them what they could and could not talk about. It's all good. <br /> <br /> Loved the episode, btw.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://ekorrengames.com\" target=\"_blank\">ekorrengames.com</a><br /> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@ekorren\" target=\"_blank\">youtube.com/@ekorren</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/482-ekorren","name":"Ekorren","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar482_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"705"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-16T04:14:06-07:00","id":1235504,"title":"","content":"Given how badly not letting lunars in animal forms use most of their charms would nutshot their viability, I'm gonna assume that was a misread too. <br /> <br /> I mean, that includes <i>excellencies. </i>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3166-elfive","name":"Elfive","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3166_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8226"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-16T04:20:55-07:00","id":1235506,"title":"","content":"Yes, a lot of this sounds neat.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Sunder the Gold</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/lunar-exalted/1235400-lunars-playtest?p=1235420#post1235420\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Also, the Miniature Giant Space-Hamster Charm, that lets you turn a kaijuu into your personal Head Pet, if you're regretting evolving your Dratini into a Dragonite.</div> </div> </div> </div>I know what the Pok\u00e9mon are, but I don't fully understand this sentence.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Sunder the Gold</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/lunar-exalted/1235400-lunars-playtest?p=1235429#post1235429\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Lunars currently don't need a special Charm or Knack or merit to steal human forms.</div> </div> </div> </div>That has two interesting implications.<br /> <br /> One is that there are stronger incentives for Lunars to acquire human shapes through murder because it's the default, and readily available to them.<br /> <br /> The other is that it's not really as much of a waste to <i>avoid</i> acquiring shapes in that manner, because you didn't have to buy the means to do so.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Sunder the Gold</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\">The Charisma Heart's Blood Charm allows you to bind someone with an oath like an Eclipse; you gain their form if they break it. Sounds manipulative, since you'd be trying to get them to swear oaths they can't keep.</div> </div> </div> </div>I wonder if the logic is kind of... you hold somebody to their word on what they'll do or how they'll conduct themselves, and if they fail, you become empowered to assume their place and do it properly.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#00ffff\">I have approximate knowledge of many things.</span><br /> <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?threads/wip-xenoblade-chronicles-the-sword-can-see-the-future.835575/\" target=\"_blank\">Write up as I play Xenoblade Chronicles.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/158-isator-levi","name":"Isator Levi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar158_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17901"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-16T05:05:22-07:00","id":1235508,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Elfive</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/lunar-exalted/1235400-lunars-playtest?p=1235504#post1235504\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Given how badly not letting lunars in animal forms use most of their charms would nutshot their viability, I'm gonna assume that was a misread too.<br /> <br /> I mean, that includes <i>excellencies. </i></div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Yeah, I'm guessing we're missing something. We could either ring up Vance or just wait until they're done with the next episode, that appears to be a deeper look into the playtest.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Isator Levi</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/lunar-exalted/1235400-lunars-playtest?p=1235506#post1235506\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I know what the Pok\u00e9mon are, but I don't fully understand this sentence.</div> </div> </div> </div>Well, it's LITERALLY Pok\u00e9mon: you shrink you Tyrant lyzard to pocket size, until you need him to go all chompy again.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Isator Levi</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/lunar-exalted/1235400-lunars-playtest?p=1235506#post1235506\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I wonder if the logic is kind of... you hold somebody to their word on what they'll do or how they'll conduct themselves, and if they fail, you become empowered to assume their place and do it properly.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yeah, I would have expected the inverse actually: you swear a deal, and get to use their shape as long as you keep your end. But maybe that's too Fae-like.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3657-sagara","name":"Sagara","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3657_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"162"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-16T05:08:43-07:00","id":1235509,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Sunder the Gold</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/lunar-exalted/1235400-lunars-playtest?p=1235443#post1235443\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Did they also misread or misrepresent that &quot;can't use Charms in animal forms&quot; thing?<br /> <br /> I'm not panicking, just curious. If something that surprising is true, then there must be a good reason.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yep. All Lunar Charms can be used in all animal forms; Protean Charms just gain enhanced effects in certain animal and human forms.<br /> <br /> The playtest document is over 200 pages and I only sent it to them a few days ago, so some stuff like that's gonna happen.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Developer for Exalted<br /> <br /> Want to write for Exalted? Look at the <a href=\"http://theonyxpath.com/submission-guidelines/\" target=\"_blank\">freelancer submission guidelines.</a><br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/user?u=451515\" target=\"_blank\">Robert Vance's Patreon</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":18}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/527-robert-vance","name":"Robert Vance","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar527_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10044"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-16T05:27:11-07:00","id":1235512,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Isator Levi</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/lunar-exalted/1235400-lunars-playtest?p=1235493#post1235493\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Hmmmm\u2026.<br /> <br /> This is not my favourite way of getting information about Lunar mechanics. I don't gel with podcasts in general, and this feels so disjointed and fragmentary; third-hand accounts and listening through keyholes. I would greatly prefer something more direct and organised.<br /> <br /> However, it's apparent that this is going to become part of the discourse now, so the options are extricate myself from Lunar discussions entirely until such time as the book starts getting previewed specifically, or just knuckle down.<br /> <br /> This playtest happened at a convention, yes? I presume that such a setting precluded signing non-disclosure agreements?</div> </div> </div> </div><a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/158-isator-levi\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar158_2.png');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"158\" data-vbnamecard=\"158\">Isator Levi</a>, I am sorry this seems to not gel with you. That genuinely bums me out, for real. We were given the playtest doc on short notice to recording our episode, and chose to throw out our previous plans to cover this thing as soon as possible. I understand how some of the vagueries and generalities could be both confusing and/or frustrating. Suffice it to say that Lunars: Fangs at the Gate is going to blow everyone's socks off when it lands!<br /> <br /> To all others: this was not part of the leak. Robert did indeed pass this on to us, with the restriction we not directly share the document. Discussing it was fine, and even encouraged.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Co-Host of <a href=\"http://www.fivepoles.com/podcast\" target=\"_blank\">The Deliberative Podcast</a><br /> Follow us on <a href=\"http://www.twitter.com/deliberativepod\" target=\"_blank\">Twitter</a>!<br /> Follow us on <a href=\"http://www.facebook.com/thedeliberativepodcast\" target=\"_blank\">Facebook</a>!<br /> Follow us on the <a href=\"http://www.fivepoles.com\" target=\"_blank\">Web</a>!<br /> Like what we do? Support us on <a href=\"http://patreon.com/thedeliberative\" target=\"_blank\">Patreon</a>!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4164-lukkychukky","name":"Lukkychukky","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4164_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"126"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-16T05:28:28-07:00","id":1235514,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Elfive</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/lunar-exalted/1235400-lunars-playtest?p=1235504#post1235504\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Given how badly not letting lunars in animal forms use most of their charms would nutshot their viability, I'm gonna assume that was a misread too.<br /> <br /> I mean, that includes <i>excellencies. </i></div> </div> </div> </div>Whoops. Yeah, we didn't have much time - less than 24 hours - to go over this stuff before recording. And it isn't a complete document. 5% character creation, 95% charms. So, we're sorry for making you anxious!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Co-Host of <a href=\"http://www.fivepoles.com/podcast\" target=\"_blank\">The Deliberative Podcast</a><br /> Follow us on <a href=\"http://www.twitter.com/deliberativepod\" target=\"_blank\">Twitter</a>!<br /> Follow us on <a href=\"http://www.facebook.com/thedeliberativepodcast\" target=\"_blank\">Facebook</a>!<br /> Follow us on the <a href=\"http://www.fivepoles.com\" target=\"_blank\">Web</a>!<br /> Like what we do? Support us on <a href=\"http://patreon.com/thedeliberative\" target=\"_blank\">Patreon</a>!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4164-lukkychukky","name":"Lukkychukky","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4164_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"126"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-16T05:30:37-07:00","id":1235515,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Sagara</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/lunar-exalted/1235400-lunars-playtest?p=1235508#post1235508\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Yeah, I would have expected the inverse actually: you swear a deal, and get to use their shape as long as you keep your end. But maybe that's too Fae-like.</div> </div> </div> </div>This is how I see it as well. It's not necessarily putting people into oaths they absolutely cannot prevent breaking, but giving you more power over people. &quot;Hey, stop cutting down all of these trees and poaching these animals, or you'll regret it.&quot; &quot;Uh, okay. Please don't hurt me.&quot; And then they do it some time later, and boom, you've got their shape.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Co-Host of <a href=\"http://www.fivepoles.com/podcast\" target=\"_blank\">The Deliberative Podcast</a><br /> Follow us on <a href=\"http://www.twitter.com/deliberativepod\" target=\"_blank\">Twitter</a>!<br /> Follow us on <a href=\"http://www.facebook.com/thedeliberativepodcast\" target=\"_blank\">Facebook</a>!<br /> Follow us on the <a href=\"http://www.fivepoles.com\" target=\"_blank\">Web</a>!<br /> Like what we do? Support us on <a href=\"http://patreon.com/thedeliberative\" target=\"_blank\">Patreon</a>!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":6}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4164-lukkychukky","name":"Lukkychukky","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4164_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"126"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-16T05:38:17-07:00","id":1235517,"title":"","content":"\u201cHead Pet\u201d is an English phrase in the American anime-watching crowd for any adorable little creature that spends the majority of its time on your head.<br /> <br /> Pikachu is a Head Pet, though technically it spends more time on Ash\u2019s shoulder or backpack.<br /> <br /> Dratini is a baby dragon Pok\u00e9mon as small as Pikachu, and its final Dragonite form is large enough for a human to ride.<br /> <br /> For the Digimon crowd, imagine turning your Greymon familiar into a smaller Agumon.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>formerly Tornado Wolf, formerly Inugami","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/636-sunder-the-gold","name":"Sunder the Gold","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar636_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5515"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-16T05:44:28-07:00","id":1235521,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Robert Vance</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/lunar-exalted/1235400-lunars-playtest?p=1235509#post1235509\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Yep. All Lunar Charms can be used in all animal forms; Protean Charms just gain enhanced effects in certain animal and human forms.<br /> <br /> The playtest document is over 200 pages and I only sent it to them a few days ago, so some stuff like that's gonna happen.</div> </div> </div> </div>Thanks for the clarification! We\u2019ll be sure to set the record straight on this!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Host of <a href=\"http://www.fivepoles.com/podcast/\" target=\"_blank\">The Deliberative Podcast</a><br /> Host of <a href=\"https://tca.edennian.com\" target=\"_blank\">Trinity Continuum Airwaves</a><br /> Original Creator of the complete <a href=\"https://www.fantasygrounds.com/forums/showthread.php?9238-Rules-Lite-New-World-of-Darkness&amp;highlight=\" target=\"_blank\">nWoD conversion of Fantasy Grounds 2</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12730-pneumapilot","name":"PneumaPilot","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12730_4.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"149"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-16T05:48:32-07:00","id":1235522,"title":"","content":"Well actually dratini is like 6 feet long, so it's a fair bit bigger than pikachu. Only about half as heavy though. Apparently it's made of Styrofoam. <br /> <br /> That said, Ash has a habit of carrying things on his head that should be way too heavy to do that with, hence all the memes about him being ripped.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3166-elfive","name":"Elfive","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3166_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8226"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-16T05:48:56-07:00","id":1235523,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The Wizard of Oz</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/lunar-exalted/1235400-lunars-playtest?p=1235453#post1235453\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Cool. I can't listen now, so your summary is helpful Sunder, thanks.</div> </div> </div> </div>No problem. I usually loathe podcasts and delight to see someone summarize them. This time I was willing to listen.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>formerly Tornado Wolf, formerly Inugami","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/636-sunder-the-gold","name":"Sunder the Gold","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar636_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5515"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-16T05:51:16-07:00","id":1235524,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lukkychukky</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/lunar-exalted/1235400-lunars-playtest?p=1235512#post1235512\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/158-isator-levi\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar158_2.png');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"158\" data-vbnamecard=\"158\">Isator Levi</a>, I am sorry this seems to not gel with you. That genuinely bums me out, for real.</div> </div> </div> </div>Please please, don't mind my hang-ups. Apart from everything else, this probably benefits more people than it mildly puts me off. Something not going 100% my way is insignificant, and if there's one thing that I can't fault, it's people being excited to get a first look at Lunars and wanting to share that.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#00ffff\">I have approximate knowledge of many things.</span><br /> <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?threads/wip-xenoblade-chronicles-the-sword-can-see-the-future.835575/\" target=\"_blank\">Write up as I play Xenoblade Chronicles.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":6}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/158-isator-levi","name":"Isator Levi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar158_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17901"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-16T06:32:23-07:00","id":1235529,"title":"","content":"Also, for those not familiar with Spelljammer (which was the D&amp;D in Spaaaace! setting) the Gnomes bred Giant Space Hamsters to run in giant wheels and power their ships. One of the books or supplements mentioned a Gnome who had bred a Miniature version (so it was a Miniature Giant Space Hamster) which was ...just a normal hamster.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>....","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":12}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/226-brilliantrain","name":"BrilliantRain","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar226_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3718"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-16T06:38:39-07:00","id":1235530,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>BrilliantRain</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/lunar-exalted/1235400-lunars-playtest?p=1235529#post1235529\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Also, for those not familiar with Spelljammer (which was the D&amp;D in Spaaaace! setting) the Gnomes bred Giant Space Hamsters to run in giant wheels and power their ships. One of the books or supplements mentioned a Gnome who had bred a Miniature version (so it was a Miniature Giant Space Hamster) which was ...just a normal hamster.</div> </div> </div> </div>Heh; I recall a few other places with that image of having hamsters run in wheels as a means of generating electricity, and yet going by my experience with my sister's hamster, I can't help but think they'd be more likely to break out and then take over the facility.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#00ffff\">I have approximate knowledge of many things.</span><br /> <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?threads/wip-xenoblade-chronicles-the-sword-can-see-the-future.835575/\" target=\"_blank\">Write up as I play Xenoblade Chronicles.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":7}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/158-isator-levi","name":"Isator Levi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar158_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17901"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-16T07:24:13-07:00","id":1235545,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>BrilliantRain</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/lunar-exalted/1235400-lunars-playtest?p=1235529#post1235529\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Also, for those not familiar with Spelljammer (which was the D&amp;D in Spaaaace! setting) the Gnomes bred Giant Space Hamsters to run in giant wheels and power their ships. One of the books or supplements mentioned a Gnome who had bred a Miniature version (so it was a Miniature Giant Space Hamster) which was ...just a normal hamster.</div> </div> </div> </div>And Minsc had one.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>STing Bronze Age Exalted","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2402-the-wizard-of-oz","name":"The Wizard of Oz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2402_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"r