nyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3166_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8226"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-17T06:12:21-07:00","id":1235883,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Equitable Remedy</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/lunar-exalted/1235400-lunars-playtest?p=1235879#post1235879\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">My only question: is the excellency still the two-attribute-stunt mechanic from the core book? If not, I don't even need to know what it is (if that goes too far from what can be said at this point); I'm just hoping that it isn't that anymore <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div>We can actually talk about excellencies in the next episode, but for the record, I love the two attribute with a stunt rule. It\u2019s very narrative and rewards creativity. To be honest, I can\u2019t remember if the playtest had it that way or not. I assumed it was the same as the antagonists chapter of the core.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Host of <a href=\"http://www.fivepoles.com/podcast/\" target=\"_blank\">The Deliberative Podcast</a><br /> Host of <a href=\"https://tca.edennian.com\" target=\"_blank\">Trinity Continuum Airwaves</a><br /> Original Creator of the complete <a href=\"https://www.fantasygrounds.com/forums/showthread.php?9238-Rules-Lite-New-World-of-Darkness&amp;highlight=\" target=\"_blank\">nWoD conversion of Fantasy Grounds 2</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12730-pneumapilot","name":"PneumaPilot","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12730_4.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"149"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-17T07:00:40-07:00","id":1235901,"title":"","content":"I'd be interested to know if there are any Charms in the playtest document that do the following:<ul><li>Allow you to &quot;flash step&quot; or otherwise move quickly in short bursts, without having to invest deeply into Dexterity.</li> <li>Attack (or at least wreck things) with your voice.</li> <li>Compensate for blindness on a long-term basis.</li> <li>Enhance Defend Other actions, again without requiring significant Dexterity investment.</li> </ul><br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Isator Levi</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/lunar-exalted/1235400-lunars-playtest?p=1235859#post1235859\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">That escalated quickly.</div> </div> </div> </div> Yeah, probably shouldn't have said that. Oh well!<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Sunder the Gold</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/lunar-exalted/1235400-lunars-playtest?p=1235874#post1235874\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I would be interested in you starting a new thread to explain how and in what ways you found the manuscript for the new Dragon-Blooded manual disappointing.</div> </div> </div> </div> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lukkychukky</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/lunar-exalted/1235400-lunars-playtest?p=1235876#post1235876\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I agree. I'd be interested to see that as well. I personally am super excited to play a DB campaign!</div> </div> </div> </div> I don't think it warrants a full thread, but I suppose I could PM you my thoughts, if you're interested.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/97-the-mg","name":"The MG","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar97_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2460"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-17T07:42:38-07:00","id":1235920,"title":"","content":"I'd be interested in knowing your thoughts on WFHW. Just in case I encounter another of my players that has similar thoughts.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Co-Host of <a href=\"http://www.fivepoles.com/podcast\" target=\"_blank\">The Deliberative Podcast</a><br /> Follow us on <a href=\"http://www.twitter.com/deliberativepod\" target=\"_blank\">Twitter</a>!<br /> Follow us on <a href=\"http://www.facebook.com/thedeliberativepodcast\" target=\"_blank\">Faceb